Pull, push, add, and status for files listed in orbit-assets.yaml. Git stores the index; R2 stores bytes.

Usage:
  orbit assets [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Hash, upload, and gitignore a file; update orbit-assets.yaml
  pull        Download missing or outdated assets for workspace repos
  push        Upload index objects that are missing from R2
  status      Show missing or mismatched local assets

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for assets

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit assets [command] --help" for more information about a command.
